Written by hand for this repository on 2026-11-18 (CC0 1.0: no rights
reserved), no third-party content, for the drawing sheet editor (wave 2 plan,
the drawing sheet addendum, section 6.3):
- every-item.kicad_wks: a kicad_wks sheet (version 20231118) holding one item
  of every kind KiCad reads: a rect, a line at each of the four corners
  (rbcorner, rtcorner, lbcorner, ltcorner; one page1only, one notonpage1, one
  with its own line width), a polygon (rotated, its own line width), a 16 by
  16 bitmap (a PNG of our own, base64 as KiCad 8 and later write it), and a
  text repeated 3 times with incrx 10 and incrlabel 1, a font (KiCad's own
  face, a line width and a size), bold, italic, a color, justify center top,
  maxlen and maxheight, and a ${TITLE} text;
- legacy.kicad_wks: the legacy page_layout form, no version, with the old
  %T, %S and %N codes (KiCad reads them as ${TITLE}, ${#} and ${##});
- broken.kicad_wks: a sheet KiCad cannot read: the text on line 7 is never
  closed, so KiCad's parser stops at the line after it;
- logo.png: a 64 by 64 PNG of our own (the same mark), for Add a logo.
